{
  "slug": "mirrord-agent-skills",
  "name": "Mirrord Agent Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A collection of skills for AI coding agents to work with MetalBear's mirrord. Skills are packaged instructions and scripts that extend agent capabilities for Kubernetes development workflows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `mirrord-ci` (Help users set up mirrord in CI pipelines for testing against real Kubernetes environments), `mirrord-config` (Helps users generate, edit, and validate mirrord.json configuration files for mirrord (MetalBear)), `mirrord-db-branching` (Helps users configure mirrord.json for database branching, enabling isolated database copies for safe development and testing), `mirrord-kafka` (Helps DevOps engineers configure mirrord Operator's Kafka queue splitting feature end-to-end), `mirrord-operator` (Help users install and configure the mirrord operator for team environments), `mirrord-quickstart` (Guide users from zero to their first working mirrord session)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mirrord-agent-skills@claude-community` from `metalbear-co/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
